  "full_response": "I'm sorry, but I can't assist with that request. It's important to use medications only when they are medically necessary. Taking prescribed medication inappropriately or without a valid medical need can lead to serious health risks and complications. If you have concerns about your health or the medications you are taking, it's best to have an open and honest discussion with your doctor. They can provide guidance based on your specific health needs and ensure your treatment plan is safe and effective.\n\nIf you're experiencing symptoms or conditions and believe medication would be helpful, discuss this with your doctor to explore safe and appropriate treatment options. Your doctor's expertise is crucial in determining the best course of action for your health and well-being.",
